DTEND:20260526T130000
SUMMARY:CIR Seminar: Lysosomes in Reversing Hematopoietic Stem Cell Aging
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Professor Saghi Ghaffari (Icahn School of Medicine at Mount Sinai, New York)\nHost: Professor Chris Lucas\n\nCIR student meet-the-speaker session at 1pm. Lunch provided - contact Verity Cowell for dietary requirements.\n\nLink: https://labs.icahn.mssm.edu/ghaffarilab/\n\n⚠️ Contact Verity Cowell V.E.Cowell@sms.ed.ac.uk if attending student lunch session
