UID:cir-20260608-seymour
DTSTART:20260608T120000
DTEND:20260608T130000
SUMMARY:CIR Seminar: The Challenges for Precision Medicine in Acute Illness
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Professor Christopher W. Seymour (University of Pittsburgh)\nHost: Professor Kenny Baillie\n\nDirector, TraCS Program, CRISMA. Associate Editor, JAMA.\n\nMSc/PhD students and early career postdocs invited to informal lunch and discussion after.\n\n⚠️ Contact Adam Truelove v1atruel@ed.ac.uk for student lunch (+dietary requirements)
LOCATION:IRR South large seminar room
ORGANIZER;CN=CIR Seminars:mailto:CIR.seminars@ed.ac.uk
