UID:crh-20260529-martins
DTSTART:20260529T140000
DTEND:20260529T150000
SUMMARY:IRR SPECIAL SEMINAR: Drug Discovery for Womens Health
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Professor Sarah Martins da Silva (University of Dundee)\nHost: Andrew Horne\n\nReproduction and Fertility Medicine - translational research on male infertility, sperm biology and drug discovery.
