UID:cvs-20260603-catapult
DTSTART:20260603T120000
DTEND:20260603T130000
SUMMARY:SEMINAR SERIES: My Journey Through Science / Who and What Are Catapult?
DESCRIPTION:Speaker 1: Alison Daniels (Cell and Gene Therapy Catapult)\n  "My Journey Through Science So Far"\nSpeaker 2: Francis Acklam (Cell and Gene Therapy Catapult)\n  "Who And What Are Catapult?"\nHost: Angus Comerford\n\nPizza social 13:00-13:30 at The Larder.\n\n⚠️ Pizza provided after seminar at The Larder, 13:00-13:30
LOCATION:Auditorium A, Shirley Hall, Chancellors Building
ORGANIZER;CN=Lorraine Vaughan:mailto:
